{"id":8795,"date":"2024-06-15T07:00:00","date_gmt":"2024-06-15T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=8795"},"modified":"2026-05-27T09:23:07","modified_gmt":"2026-05-27T09:23:07","slug":"the-contractors-guide-to-getting-more-business","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/the-contractors-guide-to-getting-more-business\/","title":{"rendered":"The Contractor&#8217;s Guide To Getting More Business"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Looking to grow your contracting business and expand your client base? You&#8217;re in the right place! In this guide, we&#8217;ll explore effective strategies and tools to track leads, manage customer relationships, and optimize your marketing efforts. Whether you&#8217;re based in Bend, OR, Redmond, OR, or Tigard, OR, this guide is packed with valuable insights to help you take your contracting business to the next level. And remember, if you need assistance implementing any of these strategies or tackling a new project, <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/\" title=\"\">Harris &amp; Sons <\/a>is here to collaborate every step of the way. Let&#8217;s dive in!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/engineer-meeting-for-architectural-project-2023-11-27-05-13-50-utc-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"home remodel map\" class=\"wp-image-8799\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Create a Lead Form<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Increasing contractor business starts with generating leads, and a well-designed lead form is crucial. Use a lead form to collect essential information from potential clients before sending them any sales material. This helps determine if they are a good fit for your services and allows you to tailor your approach.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Building contractor lead forms involves creating fields for contact information, project details, and timelines. Ensure your form is easy to navigate and accessible on your website. For example, contractors in Beaverton, OR, and Hillsboro, OR, can benefit from local insights to tailor their forms to regional preferences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Start Collecting Data About Your Prospects<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To effectively track prospects for contractors, start gathering detailed data about your potential clients. Decide on the relationship type you want with each prospect\u2014whether you aim to close a sale immediately or build a long-term relationship.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Using prospect profiling for contractors helps in understanding client needs better. Collect information such as project scope, budget, and preferred timelines. Contractors in areas like Beaverton, OR and Lake Oswego can use this data to customize their proposals and improve conversion rates.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Automate Your Marketing Efforts<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Marketing automation is a game-changer for contractor business development. Implementing a CRM (Customer Relationship Management) system helps track prospects and customers across multiple channels. This system enables you to follow up with leads who are not yet ready to buy and maintain relationships with previous clients.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contractor marketing automation tools can automate email campaigns, social media posts, and follow-up reminders. Contractors in Portland, OR, and Happy Valley, OR, can use these tools to maintain consistent communication with leads and clients without overwhelming their workload.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/our-strategy-can-only-work-if-we-combine-our-effor-2024-05-10-21-30-47-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Three individual discussing with each other\" class=\"wp-image-8801\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Build a Sales Funnel<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A structured sales funnel is essential for scaling a contracting business. This funnel guides prospects through the stages from awareness to decision-making.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Awareness:<\/strong> Use online content, such as blogs and social media posts, to attract potential clients. Topics like contractor marketing tips and contractor lead generation tactics can draw in readers.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Interest:<\/strong> Capture leads using optimized lead forms. Creating effective contractor lead forms involves making them easy to fill out and ensuring they collect pertinent information.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Decision:<\/strong> Nurture leads with automated emails and personalized content that addresses their specific needs.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Action:<\/strong> Close the sale with a compelling offer and follow-up.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Save Time with Smart Marketing Strategies<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contractor email marketing automation is a powerful tool to keep in touch with your prospects. Design sequences that educate and nurture leads over time, eventually guiding them to a purchasing decision.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Use contractor digital marketing automation to schedule posts and emails. For instance, contractors in Happy Valley, OR, and Lake Oswego, OR, can set up automated systems to engage with local audiences effectively, increasing brand visibility and client acquisition.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Optimize Your Lead Forms<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Your lead form should not only be functional but also optimized for the best results. Here are some contractor lead form best practices:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Simplicity:<\/strong> Keep the form simple and to the point.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Clear Call-to-Action:<\/strong> Make sure your call-to-action is clear and compelling.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Responsive Design:<\/strong> Ensure the form is mobile-friendly.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contractors in Bend, OR, and Tigard, OR, can benefit from these practices by making it easy for prospects to contact them, thereby increasing lead conversion rates.<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/construction-worker-and-contractor-2023-11-27-05-30-38-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Home remodel professionals\" class=\"wp-image-8803\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br>Track and Analyze Your Data<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Implement data-driven prospecting for contractors by regularly analyzing the collected data. Use a CRM to track interactions and identify patterns. This helps in refining your marketing strategies and improving your lead nurturing processes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contractor prospect analytics provides insights into which strategies are working and which need adjustment. By understanding your data, you can make informed decisions that drive business growth.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Boosting contractor revenue and expanding your business requires a strategic approach and a commitment to excellence. By incorporating lead generation techniques, implementing effective marketing strategies, and investing in data management tools, you can attract a steady stream of clients and elevate your service offerings to new heights.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At <a href=\"https:\/\/share.google\/gwM2ovux57i85a4fn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer n